---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About" description="A bit about me outside of work.">
  <h1 class="mb-6 text-2xl font-bold">about</h1>

  <div class="flex flex-col gap-8 sm:flex-row sm:gap-10">
    <img
      src="/rohit.jpg"
      alt="Rohit Upadhya"
      width="900"
      height="973"
      loading="lazy"
      class="w-full max-w-[220px] self-center border border-[color:var(--border-dim)] sm:self-start"
    />

    <div class="prose-content max-w-2xl">
      <p>
        A few things I'm into outside of work — the work itself is over on my
        <a href="/resume">CV</a>.
      </p>

      <p>I find cooking therapeutic, and I garden. I used to paint as well, though less lately.</p>

      <p>
        I read a fair bit — mostly fiction and history. History's a genuine interest, not just
        background reading, and I like stories in general, so I watch a lot of movies too.
      </p>

      <p>
        I like maths, and I'm into memes. I'm an animal person in general — as comfortable around a
        cat or a cow as a dog.
      </p>

      <p>
        I used to hike and play strategy games — Age of Empires mainly — but both have dropped off
        since work got busier.
      </p>

      <p>
        I'll be writing here fairly regularly too — mostly notes on what I'm working on and reading —
        over on the <a href="/blog">blog</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
